{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tyrium is a real-time strategy game where you build a base and harvest the valuable mineral Tyrium. This resource is refined into credits, which you use to grow your economy and expand your army. Collector units ensure a steady flow of resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your objective: Build a powerful force of tanks, rocket launchers, and infantry units to attack the enemy base and take control of the map. Victory is achieved by destroying either the enemy headquarters or all opposing units.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At this stage, the game features 5 buildings and 6 different units. Two levels of the campaign are currently playable, with more maps, units, and content already in development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Future updates will introduce new game modes such as a base defense mode with enemy waves, and a completely new playable faction with its own unique units and buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We welcome your feedback and ideas \u2014 help us shape the future of Tyrium together!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2329940?t=1756234393","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329940/34c20ce2afb33e8364eaac5a79a36a02cfe7fe1c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756234393","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329940/e0b35d7f21fae00fd2dc384bff792cc84684d24a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756234393","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329940/e0b35d7f21fae00fd2dc384bff792cc84684d24a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756234393","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3793720,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tyrium is a real-time strategy game where you build a base and harvest the valuable mineral Tyrium. This resource is refined into credits, which you use to grow your economy and expand your army. Collector units ensure a steady flow of resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your objective: Build a powerful force of tanks, rocket launchers, and infantry units to attack the enemy base and take control of the map. Victory is achieved by destroying either the enemy headquarters or all opposing units.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At this stage, the game features 5 buildings and 6 different units. Two levels of the campaign are currently playable, with more maps, units, and content already in development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Future updates will introduce new game modes such as a base defense mode with enemy waves, and a completely new playable faction with its own unique units and buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We welcome your feedback and ideas \u2014 help us shape the future of Tyrium together!</p>","developers":["Sceptical Orange"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329940/f45b5cb665dd4de48b13d3550500811400778128/header.jpg?t=1756234393","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2329940/1694946093/ec43138cc6b70cf0b5e8c784e407f765da2a8f2d/1750907415/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749469231","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2329940/1694946093/ec43138cc6b70cf0b5e8c784e407f765da2a8f2d/1750907415/dash_h264.mpd?t=1749469231","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2329940/1694946093/ec43138cc6b70cf0b5e8c784e407f765da2a8f2d/1750907415/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1749469231","id":257154083,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257154083/movie480.mp4?t=1749469231","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257154